# --- e2e/output split (intentional) ---
# Tracked: judgments (docs/decisions/) AND measurements-over-time that a future
# reader cannot cheaply reconstruct (e.g. calm-budget-run.md scoreboard at a
# known commit — git-diffable product state vs the calm bar). Regenerable is
# not the test; durable informational value is.
# Ignored: raw evidence dumps — shots, probe JSON/logs, skill dumps, drive scratch.
# Cite shot paths from reviews; do not commit shot folders.
e2e/output/
!e2e/output/calm-budget-run.md

# AI assistant harness (LOCAL ONLY — never commit / never push)
# Reason: branch checkouts must not swap the agent's brain or skills.
# Product docs about the in-app agent panel stay tracked (docs/04-agents.md, etc.).
# Full rule: docs/AGENTS_ROLES.md § "AI harness stays local"
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
AGENTS.md
.agents/
.cursor/
.cursorignore
.cursorrules
